window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>What are brothers for, if not completely ruining each other's lives?</b></p> <p>Two months at Graves Academy, and my life is a mess.</p> <p>The people I thought I could trust are monsters, and those I thought were monsters, well... I was right. Even when I do my best to distance myself from these dangerous men, the push and pull of the stars keeps us tied together. There's no reason an incubus, a vampire, or Zodiac Shifters should have any interest in a human.</p> <p>Only, on the full moon of Pisces and the full moon of Aries, I might have to confront the fact that my incubus professor, my vampire classmate, and my mysterious coworker aren't the ones who have been lying to me my entire life.</p> <p>Zodiac Monsters<i> is the second book in the Monsters of Graves Academy series, a paranormal dark academia romance set in a college where supernatural creatures hide in plain sight. You'll love it if you enjoy light Omegaverse mixed with horoscopes and astrology, enemies to lovers, student/teacher, and monster romance, finished with a splash of self-discovery and possessive, morally gray men who will fight for their very, very good girl.</i></p>"; 
